WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.012
This practice creates a patient by month admission matrix.

00:00:04.012 --> 00:00:07.907
The intended output has one row per patient.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:15.037
Month columns contain admission counts, and a total column shows the overall number of admissions.

00:00:15.037 --> 00:00:23.137
Because we start from the patient table and use a left join, patients with no admissions can still appear in the result.

00:00:23.137 --> 00:00:27.518
Again, state the grain before writing the pivot expressions.
